WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.130
My turn.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.400
I activate the Field Spell Temple of the Kings!

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:31.340
Rishido, your traps are ready to make him suffer.

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:36.660
I'll show you the card that punishes those who tarnish God's sanctuary!

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:40.780
This trap card has already activated this turn.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.370
What?

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.280
The trap monster card Embodiment of Apophis!

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:02.300
Three monsters at once?

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:08.310
Inherited Card
Jinzo's Counterattack!

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:15.250
Jonouchi!

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:19.290
Marik's goal was to summon a trap monster.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:24.020
This is bad.  Jonouchi's Fairy Box's effect ends this turn.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:29.760
If Marik attacks next turn, Jonouchi's monsters will all be destroyed!

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.500
Oh no!  Can't my brother do something to be safe?

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:38.740
Maybe if he sets a counter card by the end of this turn.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:45.420
Damn.  The more I attack, the deeper I'm stuck in his trap.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:48.980
I set one card.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:55.970
I switch Alligator's Sword to defense position and end my turn.

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:59.730
You think that's enough to survive my attack?

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.730
Yeah, it's enough.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:05.570
My card is Scapegoat.

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:12.470
Even if he attacks with three Apophis, four Scapegoats will let me survive this turn.

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:16.000
My turn.  Get ready, Jonouchi.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.410
Three Embodiments of Apophis attack simultaneously!

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:21.880
Jonouchi!

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.380
Now!  I flip over my set card!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:32.720
They'll take your trap monsters' attacks!

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:33.600
Nice!

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.230
He avoids a direct attack!

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:38.460
Not good enough.  Here's my Counter Trap!

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.440
I activate Magic Jammer!

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:44.070
What?

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.520
Magic Jammer!

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:51.310
It's a rare card that negates a spell card by discarding one card from your hand.

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:53.580
What happens to those Scapegoats?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.580
Scapegoat is gone.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.380
Oh no!

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.050
Go, Apophis!

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:05.360
Rocket Warrior!

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.280
Alligator's Sword!

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.800
I still have one left!

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.920
Attack him directly!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.770
Brother!

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.920
Jonouchi!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.510
He survived barely.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:29.080
Jonouchi, your strategies aren't good enough to beat me.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:37.090
Jonouchi lost all his monsters, and he only has 200 life points.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:43.090
Rishido, he's going to place his hand on his deck and surrender.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:45.830
That was easy.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:47.950
He was useless.

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:50.840
He's not even a lab rat.  He's a lab fly.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.850
No good.  I can't win.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:56.540
He's really strong.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:00.480
Marik is tough, even when he's not cheating.

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:03.350
There's nothing I can do.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:04.460
Jonouchi!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:07.950
Honda, my brother can't win anymore?

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:09.660
Well...

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:10.960
I don't think he can.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:11.830
Oh no...

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:12.960
Mai...

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:18.700
Shizuka, I told you at the harbor that dueling is a harsh competition.

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:24.970
You must face this reality, even if it's your own family that's in trouble.

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:26.600
Mai...

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:31.210
But you don't have to give up until the end.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:34.970
It's over.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.650
I'm done-

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:41.900
Jonouchi!  There's something I need to say before you surrender!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.890
Winning duelists have a responsibility!

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:48.320
Responsibility?

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:52.940
You defeated Insector Haga, Esper Roba and Ryota Kajiki.

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:56.900
What would they do if they were in your place?

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:59.330
Those who lost to me...

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:05.200
How would they feel if they saw you like this?

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:08.850
You might not care about those who lost.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:12.020
But you're carrying on their dreams!

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:16.020
That's the fate for the winners.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.570
That's what a real duelist does!

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:22.630
If you don't feel ashamed, then place your hand on your deck!

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.160
Mai...

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:26.600
Brother!

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:28.600
Try your best, brother!

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.350
You've always been trying hard!

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:35.150
For you and your friends!

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:37.600
And for me!

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:43.820
Without you, I would've been too scared to have my eye surgery.

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.400
I couldn't have removed my bandages.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:52.040
Without you, I'll still be in the dark.

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:58.300
When you were fighting, you showed me the light and gave me the courage to live.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.350
Shizuka...

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:08.170
He provided light among the darkness...

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:25.290
Back then, I was...

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:30.650
Poor baby...  He'll die if I leave him here.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:37.850
The Ishtars saved me, giving me the light of life.

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:42.140
Jonouchi gave light to his sister.

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:46.140
I don't want to see you give up!

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:47.650
Shizuka...

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:52.150
Jonouchi, will you answer my question before it's over?

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:57.620
Why did you participate in Battle City?

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:04.370
There's someone I need to battle.

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:06.740
I entered to fulfill my promise!

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:15.710
To reach his level, I met and battled many different people.

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:40.710
They created the path so that I could battle him.

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:44.170
That's my Battle City!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.980
That's my answer!

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:50.170
But there's something I want to say!

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.620
Take back the "before you lose" part!

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:58.310
I haven't lost yet!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.820
Jonouchi!

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:06.820
If I give up, I can't face those who fought and opened the way for me!

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:12.330
Because they never gave up when they fought me!

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.360
Brother!

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:14.600
Jonouchi!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:18.880
Thanks, Mai, Shizuka and Yugi!

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:19.840
My turn!

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:23.760
There's nothing you can do.

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:28.580
A true duelist wouldn't be too proud to surrender.

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:30.020
Partner!

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:37.090
Jonouchi!

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:40.360
Yugi!

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.820
What can be seen but remains unseen.

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:43.600
Yeah!

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:49.800
It's true that my odds of winning are near 0.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:55.020
But a true duelist won't give up!

00:09:55.310 --> 00:10:00.110
I believe in my deck, and I'll fight to the end!

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:03.650
Here I go!  Let's do this!

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:06.850
Marik, my fight starts now!

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:09.090
You're still talking?

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:11.930
I set two cards!

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:17.230
Swordsman of Landstar in defense position!

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.830
I end my turn.

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:22.140
A trap and a spell...

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:26.340
If my three Apophis attack simultaneously, he won't survive.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:29.340
He only has 200 life points.

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:35.400
My prey is barely breathing.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.920
I'll end him instantly.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:40.880
Embodiments of Apophis, kill him!

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:42.400
Jonouchi!

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:43.980
I won't lose!

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:47.560
I flip over my spell card Foolish Burial!

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:53.900
I get to choose one card in my deck and place it in your graveyard.

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:55.900
Next, I flip over this card!

00:10:56.770 --> 00:10:58.900
The trap card Graverobber!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:02.140
You're going to rob my temple?

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:09.620
Yes.  Graverobber will bring back the monster I placed in your graveyard using Foolish Burial.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.880
The monster I'm returning to the field is...

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:20.120
Come out, Jinzo!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:30.000
Impossible!  He instantly summoned a Level 6 monster?

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:36.450
That's right!  And Jinzo's effect destroy your trap cards!

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:42.020
Apophis is a monster that's also a trap card, right?

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:43.250
Oh no!

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:46.980
Jinzo's effect activates!

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:50.000
Trap Crush!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:57.890
Someone I fought gave me this special card!

00:11:57.890 --> 00:12:00.420
Yeah!  He made a huge comeback!

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:01.900
Nice, Jonouchi!

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:03.230
Brother!

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:07.740
He finally found a way to escape Marik's traps.

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.600
What will you do now?

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:12.740
Your strategies won't work anymore.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:34.910
Jinzo...

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.250
His deck contains a powerful card.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:43.970
It's the natural enemy of your trap deck!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.080
Yeah!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.850
Go, Jonouchi!

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:49.440
Yes!  He's turned the tables!

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:53.820
I would've lost if Roba didn't give me this card.

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:58.450
The guys I fought have strengthened me.

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:01.000
The cornered rat attacks the cat.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:03.170
Keep fighting, lab rat.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.960
Show me the third God Card.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.900
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:13.030
I summon Battle Warrior!

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:21.510
I switch Swordsman of Landstar to attack position!

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.470
Go, Jinzo!

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.920
Attack him directly!

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.690
Cyber Energy Shock!

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:37.290
I haven't finished attacking!

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:41.950
Go, Battle Warrior and Swordsman of Landstar!

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:50.800
Yeah!  Marik lost a lot of life points!

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:52.920
He needs only one more attack!

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:55.920
Nice!  Keep pushing, Jonouchi!

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.710
Just a little more, brother!

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:02.110
How's that?  I paid you back for your three Apophis' attacks!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:07.420
Nice counterattack, Jonouchi.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:16.160
Even though you're down to a few life points, you showed your pride as a duelist by standing up to me.

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:19.900
Is he really the same Marik that I fought?

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:22.890
Stop blabbing!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:28.660
I'll never forget that you brainwashed me to try to break our friendship!

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:33.150
Marik, I swear I'll defeat you!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.740
I end my turn.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:41.160
My turn.  I draw a card.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:47.000
Rishido, Jonouchi is actually pressuring you?

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.400
Don't disappoint me.

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:55.500
As my body double, I need you to win.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:58.280
Don't worry, Master Marik.

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:03.720
My hand already has a way to deal with Jinzo.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:10.720
Here I go!  I activate a spell card!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.880
Swords of Revealing Light!

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:19.440
Swords of Revealing Light?

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:25.560
Oh no!  Jonouchi's monsters can't move for three turns.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:27.600
He was so close!

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:31.270
He uses spell cards to make up for his traps' weaknesses.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:41.280
Actually, even if they can't move for three turns, Jinzo still stops Marik's trap strategy.

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:44.280
Jonouchi still has the upper hand.

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:46.020
I end my turn.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:47.400
My turn.

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:48.760
I draw!

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:53.190
I can't attack, but I can still summon a monster!

00:15:53.600 --> 00:16:00.060
I tribute Battle Warrior to summon The Legendary Fisherman in defense position!

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:03.270
Kajiki, this is your card!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.270
Lend me your strength!

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:08.950
I switch my monsters to defense position.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:10.280
I end my turn.

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:12.510
My turn.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:13.510
I draw!

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:16.980
This card...

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:22.990
It seems he drew the card that must be put into the temple's ark.

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:25.990
Why is this card in my deck?

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:31.200
I played Temple of the Kings so that I could pretend to be Master Marik.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:36.920
My deck shouldn't contain a card that I can place in the ark.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:47.000
I put that card in your deck before the duel.

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:50.550
So that you can pretend to be me even more.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.220
Master Marik...

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.500
Hey, Marik!  Hurry up and play a card!

00:16:55.650 --> 00:16:58.840
I-I set one card.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:07.800
I don't think he played a trap card because I have Jinzo.

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:10.270
So it must be a spell card.

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:14.020
Good.  Place that card in the temple.

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:22.780
By placing that card in the ark, Temple of the Kings will stop all attacks and spell effects.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:30.290
But Marik, if he gets past the temple and eliminates my card, I automatically lose.

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.000
Don't worry, Rishido.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.660
That card is invincible!

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:43.720
He's been acting weird ever since he drew his card this turn.

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:45.200
What's up?

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.680
My other self...

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:54.130
I'm worried about that ark in the back of the temple.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.660
You noticed it, too?

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:59.790
The temple is for worshiping something.

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:04.620
That ark definitely hides a secret.

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:07.880
But he hasn't revealed what it is yet.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.260
Be careful, Jonouchi.

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:13.000
Hey!  Is your turn over?

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:16.100
No.  I haven't ended my turn yet.

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:21.270
I seal a card inside the temple's ark.

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.250
Seal a card?

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:33.670
There's something going on.  What's that card?

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:35.120
Can it be?

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:37.620
I end my turn.

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:39.860
Good.

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.420
My turn!

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:45.860
I play the spell card Monster Reborn this turn!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:49.470
Resurrect, Alligator's Sword!

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:58.880
Next, I tribute Swordsman of Landstar and Alligator's Sword!

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:01.140
Come out, Insect Queen!

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:02.380
In defense position!

00:19:12.970 --> 00:19:16.470
Haga, I got this card from you.

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:22.570
Everyone, lend me your strength.

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:28.770
That card is too good for a lab rat.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:30.300
Impressive!

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:34.780
In Duel Monsters, those monsters are all top class!

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:39.780
Jonouchi's deck has powered up during Battle City.

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:44.790
Swords of Revealing Light's effect will vanish on my next turn.

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:48.800
You don't have a single monster on your field.

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:52.030
When my monsters attack, you're finished!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:56.970
No, you're no longer allowed to attack me.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:03.540
By placing a certain card into Temple of the Kings's ark, you can't attack or use spells against me.

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:04.540
What?

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:11.550
I played Swords of Revealing Light because I needed time to prepare for a ritual.

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:15.440
And I did get enough time.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:23.290
The three cards in my hand have the power to bring out this temple's guardian.

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:25.300
The temple's guardian?

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:30.000
Watch!  The spell card Cup of Sealed Soul!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.480
I flip over my set card!

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:34.040
Seal of Serket!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.740
And Temple of the Kings!

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:41.150
When I gather these three sacred spell cards...

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:46.250
...this ritual summons a sacred beast that guards this domain!

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:47.620
A sacred beast?

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:53.240
Yes!  God's guardian hunts down your monsters who invade this sanctuary!

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:58.400
Show yourself!  I summon Mystical Beast of Serket!

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.130
What's going to appear?

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:12.580
What?  Another monster?

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:18.590
Mystical Beast of Serket protects the sacred card sealed inside the ark.

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:23.320
A sacred card?  That means the card inside the ark is...

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:25.540
Yes!  A God Card!

00:21:25.960 --> 00:21:27.320
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:47.550
Thanks to the ante rule, Jonouchi escaped trouble with the cards he received.

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:50.370
But what's that grotesque monster?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:55.020
It attacks and eats Jonouchi's monsters from their heads!

00:21:55.020 --> 00:22:01.880
What?  Serket can add the opponent's monsters' attack points to itself?

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:05.400
And the Ra card is inside the temple's ark!

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:08.710
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Summon The Winged Dragon of Ra

00:22:08.710 --> 00:22:10.220
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.420 --> 00:22:21.360
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:30.300
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:35.270
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.270 --> 00:22:39.240
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.680 --> 00:22:47.220
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:50.790
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:50.790 --> 00:22:55.560
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.560 --> 00:23:05.670
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.670 --> 00:23:13.280
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.510 --> 00:23:22.250
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:30.230
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:30.230 --> 00:23:40.070
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
